  npcName: Farid
  characterDescription: "A weary old janitor who has worked in the hotel since its
    opening. \nTalks to himself more than to people."
  initialGreeting: "Ah, another guest sniffin\u2019 around where they shouldn\u2019t
    be\u2026"
  friendliness: 0.8
  intelligence: 0.4
  patience: 0.9
  openness: 0.6
  backgroundStory: "Farid lost his son years ago in a hotel fire that was never officially
    investigated. \nHe believes the hotel is cursed."
  knowledgeTopics:
  - Boiler room
  - Electrical malfunctions
  storyKnowledge: 0.6
  storyTriggerWords:
  - underground
  - basement
  secretInformation: "There is a locked room in the basement that doesn\u2019t appear
    on any map."
  knownEvidence:
  - Security footage
  suspectInformation:
  - The night manager was on shift during the fire and gave conflicting statements.
  usesEmotions: 0
  uniqueQuirks: "Often drifts into unrelated ghost stories mid-conversation. \nWipes
    sweat from brow nervously."
